  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fldtteam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/image.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"401\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.minecolonies.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/139070364159311872/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<p>MineColonies🏛️ 官方整合包 &mdash; 收錄了 MineColonies、其核心依賴模組，以及精心挑選的必備模組，為您帶來流暢、高效且沉浸式的殖民建造體驗。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rDNMBiT.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecolonies.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecolonies</a> 模組是一款互動式城鎮建造模組，讓您能在《Minecraft》中打造繁榮的城鎮。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a>。該模組透過提供多種可製作的選項來模擬真實生活情境，幫助您建造專屬城鎮並提升遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p>內建眾多 NPC 工人，例如：建築師、工匠、農民、漁夫、衛兵、礦工、冶煉工、麵包師、廚師、送貨員、畜牧員等，未來還將持續擴充更多職業。同時提供專屬建築，如倉庫、市民小屋與市政廳。Minecolonies 讓每位玩家都能打造出豐富且獨一無二的殖民地。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/250424/description_30b15c4b-8e4c-4a90-ab1c-5a7c1a163f19.jpg\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uj96QH8.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在 Patreon 上支持我們：<br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies</a></p>\n<p><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/patreon-img.png?raw=true\" width=\"448\" height=\"224\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我們的維基：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.minecolonies.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wiki.minecolonies.com/</a> 在此回報問題（<strong>請先搜尋</strong>）：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/minecolonies/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Minecolonies/minecolonies</a></p>\n<p>瀏覽我們的網站：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://www.minecolonies.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecolonies.com/</a><br><br>需要伺服器來遊玩 Minecolonies？點擊此處即可獲得折扣，同時支持本專案：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fldtteam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/ldtteam</a><br><br></p>",
